body:
Hi @kemsky, thanks for reporting the issue. We performed the investigation and it looks like the problem only happens in case custom Pipe is defined as a part of `declarations` array of an NgModule, i.e.:

```
@NgModule({
  imports: [CommonModule],
  declarations: [CustomNumberPipe],
})
class SomeModule {}
```
However if you declare a pipe in a separate module and import it, the framework works as expected, i.e.:

```
@NgModule({
  declarations: [CustomNumberPipe],
  exports: [CustomNumberPipe],
})
class CustomNumberPipeModule {}

@NgModule({
  imports: [CommonModule, CustomNumberPipeModule],
})
class SomeModule {}
```

I've created a draft PR https://github.com/angular/angular/pull/35850 to make sure the `declarations` field has higher priority in the first case that I described.

Could you please confirm that the Pipes/NgModule layout that you have in your app is similar to the first scenario that I described?

Thank you.

@kemsky if you get a chance, it'd be great if you could also help verify that the changes from PR #35850 resolve the issue. Note: PR still requires code review and testing, so the final implementation might be changed.

You can follow an instruction in [this document on how to use PR artifacts](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/docs/DEVELOPER.md#archives-for-each-package) in your app. An archive with updated `@angular/core` package that contains changes from the PR is available [here](https://642504-24195339-gh.circle-artifacts.com/0/angular/core-pr35850-ccd466f934.tgz) and updated `@angular/compiler-cli` can be found [here](https://642504-24195339-gh.circle-artifacts.com/0/angular/compiler-cli-pr35850-ccd466f934.tgz) (please make sure you update other `@angular` packages to `9.0.4` to avoid version conflicts). **Note**: the mentioned archives with updated `@angular/core` and `@angular/compiler-cli` packages are for **testing purposes only** and not suitable for production usage (that archive will be removed once PR is merged to master or closed).

Thank you.
